    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Story:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After receiving an anonymous 'love' letter, a desire for a new romance sparks within Reina. The mystery of its sender sends her searching for answers at her house party. Three men stand out\u2014each with their own charm, each a potential contender for her heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But is the letter from one of them? Or could it hide a darker secret, one that has nothing to do with love at all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Character:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531660/extras/0d730aa3e819fc454b5910033696e991.avif?t=1752758872\" width=800 height=398 /></span><u>About:</u><br><strong>Unwahrheit</strong> is a <i>psychological\u00a0horror-</i>romance visual novel (<strong>otome game)</strong>. The goal is to help Reina find her new boyfriend and lead her towards a happily ever after. Choose between three of the dateable men and find out who the secret admirer is.  <br><br><i>The demo contains around 17,000 words (approximately 40 minutes of gameplay)<u></u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three character routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic choices that influence the outcome of the narrative, branching story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different character POVS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Story:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After receiving an anonymous 'love' letter, a desire for a new romance sparks within Reina. The mystery of its sender sends her searching for answers at her house party. Three men stand out\u2014each with their own charm, each a potential contender for her heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But is the letter from one of them? Or could it hide a darker secret, one that has nothing to do with love at all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Character:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531660/extras/0d730aa3e819fc454b5910033696e991.avif?t=1752758872\" width=800 height=398 /></span><u>About:</u><br><strong>Unwahrheit</strong> is a <i>psychological\u00a0horror-</i>romance visual novel (<strong>otome game)</strong>. The goal is to help Reina find her new boyfriend and lead her towards a happily ever after. Choose between three of the dateable men and find out who the secret admirer is.  <br><br><i>The demo contains around 17,000 words (approximately 40 minutes of gameplay)<u></u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Features:</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three character routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic choices that influence the outcome of the narrative, branching story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different character POVS</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings </p></li></ul>",
